# Every file in this repository is LF on every platform.
#
# The monorepo keeps core.autocrlf on. This rule makes a Windows checkout of
# the starter write LF, so the shell scripts run in WSL and the build identity
# hash does not depend on the platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The vendored OpenSBI firmware is a binary. Git must not normalize it.
firmware/*.bin binary
